    <!-- Community -->
    <string name="tg_cm_title">Community</string>
    <string name="tg_cm_body">Ask for advice and share what you know. Nobody sees your name.</string>
    <string name="tg_cm_rules_title">Before you join in</string>
    <string name="tg_cm_rules_body">• You are anonymous. Every conversation gives you a different made-up name.\n• Be kind. No abuse, shaming or hate.\n• Do not share names, phone numbers, addresses, links or anything that identifies you or someone else.\n• Nobody here is verified. Never agree to meet or move to a private chat with someone from this space.\n• Report anything that breaks these rules. Posts reported by several people are hidden.\n• This is not an emergency service. If you are in danger, use SOS or call 112.</string>
    <string name="tg_cm_rules_ok">I understand</string>
